menu "WiFi Dap UART TCP bridge"

    config BIRDIEBOT_UART_BRIDGE_ENABLE
        bool "Enable the UART TCP bridge (TCP 1346)"
        default y
        help
            Forwards a raw TCP connection on port 1346 to the target UART
            (115200-8N1 by default, A 2025 defaults; the old 1234/74880 values
            are deprecated) and back.  UART instance and TX/RX pins come from
            the selected board (components/board, docs/board-pins.md).

            The bridge is unauthenticated and plain-text: enable it only on a
            trusted LAN (docs/INTEGRATION-PLAN.md P7.1).

            Default: y (laboratory mode, same as the fork).

endmenu
